From 806aa545a79be1e5dd8f7c915dd79a0f66862f71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 03:02:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Phase 2: per-store hours + weather + pop-up window
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Per-store hours:
- hours.getStatus(locId) now reads THAT store's Square location hours (cached per
  location id) and applies a per-store weekly-hours override + per-store closures.
- New /api/hours?location=<id> returns the selected store's open/closed status
  AND its weather; the app refetches it on store switch and patches config, so
  the closed banner, reopen countdown and temperature chip all follow the store.

Per-store weather:
- weather.js caches per coordinate (Sutton ≠ Mitchell) with per-coord single-
  flight; getWeather/forConfig/peek accept a store; coordsFor() falls back to the
  global store coords when a store sets none.

Pop-up locations (locations.js as the single resolver):
- Each location has type physical|popup; a pop-up carries startDate/endDate.
  active()/publicList() drop pop-ups past their end date automatically and mark
  upcoming ones (status:'upcoming', daysUntilOpen) for the app's teaser.

Admin Locations tab: per store — type selector, pop-up open/close dates, an
optional custom weekly-hours editor, and weather coordinates.

Backward compatible: a store that sets no custom hours/weather falls back to its
Square hours and the global weather location; single-site deploys are unchanged.
